~ start
Mabel: [[Hello|Greetings|Good day]] Traveler, What would you wish to speek about?
~ ask
- Where can I go to explore the ruins.
	Mabel: There is an elivator to my left that will take you to a chamber below here, I recomend starting there.
- Where are we?
	Mabel: this is a ruin outpost. its a chamber that was cleared by a traveler long ago.
	Mabel: now it acts as a safehaven for those who wish to venture further into the forgoten.
	Mabel: what makes this chamber so special, however, was the discovery that the souls of those who perish within its reach are returned here, to live on once more.
	Mabel: if the worst comes to you in the ruins, true death will not find you.
	Mabel: I recomend you aviod that outcome though, as its quite the unplesant experience.
	=> ask
- Who are you?
	Mabel: My name is Mabel, I look after this place, and do my best to help the travelers who explore these ruins.
	=> ask
- Nevermind
#- Start again => start
#	- End the conversation => END
	Mabel: I wish you well, traveler.
	#do Global.in_menu = false
	do Global.dialogue_end()
	do dialogue_done()
	=> END